pc98door 1.0.0 for EleBBS
PC-9801 door for SyncTERM callers
Lists disk images and runs Neko Project
64-bit ARM Linux with np2kai_libretro.so
Ctrl-Q leaves the game and returns
Runs in the local terminal
bios, roms, and save sit beside the program
Firmware and disk images are not included
GPL-2.0-or-later, Martin Kazmaier 2026
